            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(necromancy, occult)\n\nWhen the watchtower shadow is destroyed, it re-forms, fully healed, at the watchtower after 12 hours. Destroying the shadow and lighting its watchtower's brazier permanently destroys it."
